-# Movie Search App
+# Movie Search
 
-A movie search application built with Next.js and the MovieDB API.
+A responsive movie discovery app built with **Next.js, TypeScript, and Ant Design**. Search by title, explore film details, and keep a list of movies you have rated using a TMDB guest session.
 
-## Live Demo
+## Live demo
 
-https://movies-app-sa4b.vercel.app/
+[Open Movie Search](https://movies-app-sa4b.vercel.app/)
+
+The existing deployment serves the previous version until these changes are merged and redeployed.
 
 ## Features
 
-- Search movies by title with debounce (0.5s delay)
-- Pagination — 20 movies per page, server-side
-- Star rating system — rates are saved to MovieDB via guest session
-- Rated tab — shows only movies you have rated
-- Real genres fetched from MovieDB API and displayed on each card
-- Rating circle in the top-right corner of each card, color changes based on score
-- Loading indicator shown during data fetch
-- Error handling for API failures
-- Offline detection — shows a warning if there is no internet connection
-
-## Tech Stack
-
-- Next.js 16 (App Router, TypeScript)
-- Ant Design 6
-- date-fns
-- lodash (debounce)
-- MovieDB API
